WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:15.751
"You like to race?" said Dipper.

2
00:00:15.752 --> 00:00:20.023
"You must be fast, Eddy!"

3
00:00:20.024 --> 00:00:28.879
Eddy frowned.

4
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.969
"I'm slow," he said.

5
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:35.126
"I just wish I was fast."

6
00:00:35.127 --> 00:00:38.349
"I bet you're fast," said Dipper.

7
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:49.751
"Let's all race!"

8
00:00:49.752 --> 00:00:52.659
"Okay," said Eddy.

9
00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.711
"Yay!" said Poppy.

10
00:00:55.712 --> 00:01:08.108
"This will be fun," said Jeb.

11
00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:12.835
Everyone lined up.

12
00:01:12.836 --> 00:01:15.592
Poppy looked at everyone.

13
00:01:15.593 --> 00:01:18.427
"Ready, set . . ."

14
00:01:18.428 --> 00:01:21.418
Honk! Honk!

15
00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:27.951
Eddy took off.

16
00:01:27.952 --> 00:01:34.577
Dipper played music.

17
00:01:34.578 --> 00:01:48.571
Jeb rolled slowly.

18
00:01:48.572 --> 00:01:51.545
Poppy drove through a puddle.

19
00:01:51.546 --> 00:01:54.414
"Woo-hoo!" cried Poppy.

20
00:01:54.415 --> 00:02:15.310
She drove through the puddle again.

21
00:02:15.311 --> 00:02:22.065
Eddy won!

22
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:26.435
"Yay!" His friends cheered.

23
00:02:26.436 --> 00:02:32.477
"You're fast!" they said.

24
00:02:32.478 --> 00:02:35.292
A race car drove over.

25
00:02:35.293 --> 00:02:40.230
He had fancy stripes.

26
00:02:40.231 --> 00:02:43.757
"You're not fast," said the car.

27
00:02:43.758 --> 00:02:49.324
"You're just a slow dump truck!"
